** AUTHORED TEMPLATE — comparator/tran_decision: clocked decision transient (StrongARM-style).
** A fixed differential overdrive VOD straddles VCM; the clock runs two full periods and the
** SECOND rising edge (a settled, post-startup evaluation) is measured: clk->voutp propagation
** delay, decided output levels mid-evaluation (AT=TMEAS, inside the clk-high window), and the
** clock-period average supply current. TRIG/TARG + AVG meas lines carry suffixes the result
** parser skips, so scalars are re-printed clean.
** Port convention: vdd voutp voutn vinp vinn clk vss. voutp is the side that decides HIGH for
